{
  "reason": "The renderer reads queue_snapshot.revision/items/status/error directly. Nesting an admitted unsolicited update under snapshot made the queue ignore live additions, consumption and durability failures until a later explicit refresh. Both resumed-session hydration and unsolicited updates must publish the same flat renderer event, while named RPC replies retain their snapshot wrapper. Rejected revisions, reply-scoped frames and stale connections must not publish an update.",
